    "Sub-band": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sous-bande"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sunday hike": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sortie du dimanche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TCP": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TCP · MeshCore companion · not encrypted": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP · MeshCore companion · non chiffré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to load from GIPHY": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touche pour le charger depuis GIPHY"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Telemetry: battery and status": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télémétrie : batterie et état"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Telemetry: position": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télémétrie : position"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Telemetry: sensors": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télémétrie : capteurs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 24 words of this identity": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les 24 mots de cette identité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SOS stays on until you stop it. It does not replace 112.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le SOS reste actif jusqu'à ce que tu l'arrêtes. Il ne remplace pas le 112."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The admin password is never kept on this phone. Guests can read the status only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le mot de passe admin n’est jamais gardé sur ce téléphone. Les invités peuvent seulement lire l’état."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app stopped before delivery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'app s'est arrêtée avant la remise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The arrow follows your phone · ±%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La flèche suit ton téléphone · ±%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bearing and the distance appear with your GPS fix.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le cap et la distance apparaissent avec ta position GPS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection drops and comes back in a few seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La connexion coupe et revient en quelques secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The content did not match its fingerprint: dropped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le contenu ne correspond pas à son empreinte : abandonné."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The database it exports: your direct messages and channel posts join your MeshCore chats.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La base qu’elle exporte : tes messages directs et de canaux rejoignent tes discussions MeshCore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The demo network uses an identity of its own, thrown away when you leave it. Yours, and its 24 words, are back then.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le réseau de démo utilise une identité à lui, jetée quand tu le quittes. La tienne, et ses 24 mots, reviennent alors."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The demo's identity": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’identité de la démo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le téléchargement a échoué."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first position goes out in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La première position part dans un instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The group changed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le groupe a changé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The history could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’historique n’a pas pu être lu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The identity could not be saved on this phone. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’identité n’a pas pu être enregistrée sur ce téléphone. Réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The latest changes to the group have not reached them. lichen tries again every hour for a day, and at once when they ask for the keys.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les derniers changements du groupe ne leur sont pas parvenus. lichen réessaie toutes les heures pendant une journée, et tout de suite quand ils demandent les clés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The licence is on the page above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La licence est sur la page ci-dessus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lock stays off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le verrouillage reste désactivé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The map waits while Tor is on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La carte attend pendant que Tor est activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The message database on this phone could not be opened, often because the phone is full. Nothing was sent or deleted: free some space, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La base de messages de ce téléphone n’a pas pu être ouverte, souvent parce que le téléphone est plein. Rien n’a été envoyé ni supprimé : libère de la place, puis réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The message is empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le message est vide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The message is too long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le message est trop long."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The numbers match": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les chiffres correspondent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The one you choose can invite, remove and rename, and you leave. Closing the group ends it on every phone; the messages already received stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La personne choisie pourra inviter, retirer et renommer, et tu pars. Fermer le groupe le termine sur chaque téléphone ; les messages déjà reçus restent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone's clock is not set yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'horloge du téléphone n'est pas encore réglée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone's storage could not be read or written.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le stockage du téléphone n’a pas pu être lu ou écrit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone’s secure storage can’t be read at the moment, often before the first unlock. Nothing was changed: unlock the phone, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le stockage sécurisé du téléphone est illisible pour le moment, souvent avant le premier déverrouillage. Rien n’a été modifié : déverrouille le téléphone, puis réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio closed the link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La radio a fermé le lien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio did not add it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La radio ne l’a pas ajouté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio did not take this setting": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La radio n’a pas pris ce réglage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio does not take this setting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La radio n’accepte pas ce réglage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio has no free channel slot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La radio n'a plus d'emplacement de canal libre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio has not reported any node yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La radio n’a encore signalé aucun nœud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio keeps receiving while lichen is locked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La radio continue de recevoir pendant que lichen est verrouillé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio refused the trace.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La radio a refusé le traçage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio stops following it. Its messages stay here until you delete the conversation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La radio arrête de le suivre. Ses messages restent ici jusqu'à ce que tu supprimes la conversation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio will only hear radios on %@. Now: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La radio n’entendra plus que les radios sur %1$@. Maintenant : %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio's GPS": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le GPS de la radio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio's GPS has no fix yet: it needs open sky. Until then, it can advertise this phone's position.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le GPS de la radio n’a pas encore de position : il lui faut le ciel dégagé. En attendant, elle peut annoncer la position de ce téléphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same on both phones: nobody in between. Compare them aloud, or over another channel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Identiques sur les deux téléphones = pas d'intermédiaire. À comparer de vive voix ou par un autre canal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transfer took too long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le transfert a pris trop de temps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their GPS position comes every 2 minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa position GPS arrive toutes les 2 minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their beacons no longer reach you: move, or ask the group.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ses balises ne t’arrivent plus : déplace-toi, ou demande au groupe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their exact position is on the map; open lichen to follow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa position exacte est sur la carte ; ouvre lichen pour la suivre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their identity is not known yet: exchange a message or scan their code first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son identité n'est pas encore connue : échangez un message ou scanne son code d'abord."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their key changed again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa clé a encore changé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their key changed: compare": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa clé a changé : comparer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their key is not known yet: exchange a message first, or scan their code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa clé n'est pas encore connue : échangez d'abord un message, ou scanne son code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their key is not verified yet. Compare the numbers with them, in person or on a call.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa clé n’est pas encore vérifiée. Compare les chiffres avec cette personne, en face ou au téléphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their messages, introductions and group posts no longer reach this phone, and their posts already in your groups are hidden. They are not told. Their position and SOS in a group still show.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ses messages, ses présentations et ses messages de groupe n’arrivent plus sur ce téléphone, et ceux déjà dans tes groupes sont masqués. Cette personne n’est pas prévenue. Sa position et son SOS dans un groupe s’affichent toujours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their phone adds you over LoRa, usually within a minute or two. You can close this screen: the group appears in your conversations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son téléphone t'ajoute par LoRa, en général en une ou deux minutes. Tu peux fermer cet écran : le groupe apparaîtra dans tes conversations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their phone is not reachable: offline, or the app is closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son téléphone est injoignable : hors ligne, ou l'app est fermée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their phone sends beacons: locate them by radio.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son téléphone envoie des balises : localise par radio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their phone verifies you the same way, and both of you see the same numbers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son téléphone te vérifie de la même façon, et vous voyez tous les deux les mêmes chiffres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their radio did not answer the handshake: off, out of range, or their app is closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa radio n'a pas répondu à la poignée de main : éteinte, hors de portée, ou l'app fermée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their radio transmits at %d dBm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa radio émet à %d dBm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no full version to ask for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n'y a pas de version complète à demander."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is nothing to back up yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien à sauvegarder pour l’instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These 24 words are not the ones of this backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces 24 mots ne sont pas ceux de cette sauvegarde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These messages use MeshCore's own encryption, between your two radios: AES-128 with a short check, no forward secrecy, and the radios see the text. Good for talking with people who use a MeshCore app; use lichen for anything private.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces messages utilisent le chiffrement de MeshCore, entre vos deux radios : AES-128 avec un contrôle court, sans confidentialité persistante, et les radios voient le texte. Bien pour parler avec ceux qui utilisent une appli MeshCore ; pour tout ce qui est privé, utilise lichen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They answer pings in SOS or when they let the group locate them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La personne répond aux pings en SOS, ou si elle laisse le groupe la localiser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They differ": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ils sont différents"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They turned their SOS off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le SOS a été arrêté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This MeshCore link could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce lien MeshCore n’a pas pu être lu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This backup is damaged or incomplete: nothing was restored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette sauvegarde est abîmée ou incomplète : rien n’a été restauré."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This backup was made by a newer version of lichen: update the app first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette sauvegarde vient d’une version plus récente de lichen : mets d’abord l’app à jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C’est définitif."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code has expired": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce code a expiré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code holds the channel's secret: anyone who scans it, with lichen or a MeshCore app, reads %@ and can post in it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce code contient le secret du canal : quiconque le scanne, avec lichen ou une app MeshCore, lit %@ et peut y écrire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code names another identity than the one this contact has. Compare safety numbers with them before accepting the change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce code indique une autre identité que celle de ce contact. Compare vos numéros de sécurité avant d’accepter le changement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
