          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente de ta position"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting to be sent": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente d'envoi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is sent": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui sera envoyé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is stored on this phone is not a valid identity. Restore it from its 24 words, or start a new identity.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui est enregistré sur ce téléphone n’est pas une identité valide. Restaure-la depuis ses 24 mots, ou crée une nouvelle identité."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What lichen did lately, for its developers: versions, your radio's model, firmware and settings, and the recent log of the app. No message, key, name or position is in it. Read it, then send it with a few words on what went wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que lichen a fait récemment, pour ses développeurs : les versions, le modèle de ta radio, son firmware et ses réglages, et le journal récent de l’app. Aucun message, aucune clé, aucun nom ni aucune position n’y figure. Relis-le, puis envoie-le avec quelques mots sur ce qui n’a pas marché."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What people with a MeshCore app see": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que voient les utilisateurs d'une appli MeshCore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a member of your groups sends an SOS, follow it here, with or without their GPS. To locate someone else, open a group and choose them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand un membre de tes groupes envoie un SOS, suis-le ici, avec ou sans GPS. Pour localiser quelqu’un d’autre, ouvre un groupe et choisis la personne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you pair, iOS asks for the 6 digits shown on the radio's screen: type them in its prompt. The radio then stays paired with this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l'appairage, iOS demande les 6 chiffres affichés sur l'écran de la radio : saisis-les dans sa fenêtre. La radio reste ensuite appairée à ce téléphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who may ask your radio for them. Contacts are chosen in the MeshCore app. lichen's own positions always travel encrypted, only to the people you choose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qui peut les demander à ta radio. Les contacts se choisissent dans l’app MeshCore. Les positions de lichen voyagent toujours chiffrées, seulement vers les personnes que tu choisis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who runs the group after you?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qui gère le groupe après toi ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whoever scans it joins": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qui le scanne le rejoint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With %@. You did not verify this person in person: join only if you know them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec %@. Tu n'as pas vérifié cette personne en vrai : ne rejoins que si tu la connais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Face ID or your passcode": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec Face ID ou ton code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Touch ID or your passcode": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec Touch ID ou ton code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With your passcode": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec ton code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Within %@ of here, around you. Move a few hundred metres or add a bearing: other places narrow it down.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À moins de %@ d’ici, tout autour. Déplace-toi de quelques centaines de mètres ou ajoute un relèvement : d’autres endroits affinent la zone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a backup, losing this phone means losing your identity and your verified contacts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans sauvegarde, perdre ce téléphone, c'est perdre ton identité et tes contacts vérifiés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mot %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write these 24 words on paper, in order, and keep them somewhere safe. Anyone who has them can be you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écris ces 24 mots sur papier, dans l'ordre, et garde-les en lieu sûr. Qui les a peut se faire passer pour toi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written while my radio is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrit pendant que ma radio est éteinte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are already in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu fais déjà partie de %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are not locating this person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu ne localises pas cette personne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You blocked %@. Nothing they send reaches this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as bloqué %@. Rien de ce que cette personne envoie n’arrive sur ce téléphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You blocked this contact: unblock them first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as bloqué ce contact : débloque-le d’abord."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You closed the group": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as fermé le groupe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You created the group": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as créé le groupe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You joined %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as rejoint %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You left the group": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as quitté le groupe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You made %@ admin": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as confié le groupe à %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You removed %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as retiré %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You renamed the group “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as renommé le groupe « %@ »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You scanned their code in person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as scanné son code en personne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You set messages to disappear after %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as réglé les messages pour disparaître après %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You stop receiving its messages and your location shares with it stop. What you received stays on this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu ne reçois plus ses messages et tes partages de position avec lui s’arrêtent. Ce que tu as reçu reste sur ce téléphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You turned off disappearing messages": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as désactivé les messages éphémères"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your answer was not sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta réponse n’a pas été envoyée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your code carries your radio's address, so people can reach you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton code contient l'adresse de ta radio, pour qu'on puisse te joindre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your contact code": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton code de contact"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your contacts will see a new identity and will have to verify you again. Restore your 24 words instead if you have them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes contacts verront une nouvelle identité et devront te vérifier à nouveau. Si tu as tes 24 mots, restaure-les plutôt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your conversations, contacts and groups stay on this phone whichever radio you use. Each radio keeps its own MeshCore contacts, channels and settings, and the people you write to see a different node when you switch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes conversations, contacts et groupes restent sur ce téléphone, quelle que soit la radio. Chaque radio garde ses propres contacts MeshCore, canaux et réglages, et les personnes à qui tu écris voient un autre nœud quand tu changes de radio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your cost: %@ · ≈ %@ s of airtime · relays add theirs, no acknowledgement": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton coût : %@ · ≈ %@ s d’antenne · les relais ajoutent le leur, sans accusé de réception"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your exact GPS position, again every 2 minutes. Without GPS, a beacon your groups can locate by radio.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta position GPS exacte, toutes les 2 minutes. Sans GPS, une balise que tes groupes peuvent localiser par radio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your identity": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton identité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your identity can’t be used right now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton identité est inutilisable pour le moment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your key's fingerprint": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Empreinte de ta clé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your last reading: %d dBm, %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta dernière mesure : %d dBm, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your messages are encrypted on this phone, and the key that opened them is gone: the phone’s secure storage was reset. Without it they can’t be read. Restore a backup, or start again with an empty history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes messages sont chiffrés sur ce téléphone, et la clé qui les ouvrait a disparu : le stockage sécurisé du téléphone a été réinitialisé. Sans elle, ils ne peuvent pas être lus. Restaure une sauvegarde, ou repars avec un historique vide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your messages are encrypted on this phone, and the key that opens them can’t be read at the moment, often before the first unlock. Nothing was changed: unlock the phone, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes messages sont chiffrés sur ce téléphone, et la clé qui les ouvre ne peut pas être lue pour le moment, souvent avant le premier déverrouillage. Rien n’a été modifié : déverrouille le téléphone, puis réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your messages can’t be opened": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes messages ne peuvent pas être ouverts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your messages can’t be opened right now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes messages ne peuvent pas être ouverts pour l’instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your messages can’t be saved right now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes messages ne peuvent pas être enregistrés pour le moment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your messages, contacts and groups on this phone are removed for good. Your identity stays: your contacts still know you. Restore a backup instead if you have one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes messages, contacts et groupes sur ce téléphone sont supprimés pour de bon. Ton identité reste : tes contacts te reconnaissent toujours. Restaure plutôt une sauvegarde si tu en as une."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your messages, contacts, groups and media in one file your 24 words open": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes messages, contacts, groupes et médias dans un fichier que tes 24 mots ouvrent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your messages, contacts, groups, settings and media come back from a backup file. It replaces the identity and the messages on this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes messages, contacts, groupes, réglages et médias reviennent d’un fichier de sauvegarde. Il remplace l’identité et les messages de ce téléphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton nom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your new identity could not be saved on this phone. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta nouvelle identité n’a pas pu être enregistrée sur ce téléphone. Réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your onion service is reachable": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton service onion est joignable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone answers their locating pings even outside SOS": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton téléphone répond à leurs pings de localisation, même hors SOS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone answers their pings: SOS, or you let the group locate you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton téléphone répond à leurs pings : SOS, ou tu laisses le groupe te localiser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your position is not known yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta position n'est pas encore connue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your position is not known yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta position n’est pas encore connue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your radio already follows this channel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta radio suit déjà ce canal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your radio floods to reach it until it learns a path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta radio l’atteint par inondation tant qu’elle n’a pas appris de chemin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your radio hears it without a repeater.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta radio l’entend sans répéteur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your radio measures each of their transmissions it hears directly, where you stand; the group shares its measures and every phone works out where they probably are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta radio mesure chaque émission qu’elle entend directement, là où tu es ; le groupe partage ses mesures et chaque téléphone calcule où la personne se trouve probablement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your radio transmits at %d dBm while locating, then goes back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta radio émet à %d dBm pendant la localisation, puis revient à la normale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your radio will follow it, muted. Everyone who has this code reads it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta radio le suivra, en sourdine. Tous ceux qui ont ce code le lisent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
